---
import Money from "./Money.astro";
---
<section class="panel"><h2>Funding your shared budget</h2><p>A contribution reduces private funding and adds the same amount to shared funding. It is separate from earned income.</p><p class="muted">After changing the planned amount, balance and save both monthly budgets.</p>
 <form class="inline-form" data-op="contributions:savePlanned" data-money="planned"><Money name="planned" label="Planned contribution"/><button type="submit">Save planned amount</button><p data-message role="alert"></p></form>
 <h3>Suggested bank matches</h3><p>Confirm a match only when these entries record the same transfer.</p><div data-list="suggestions"></div>
 <template data-row="suggestions"><div class="alert-row"><span><strong data-text="amount"></strong><small data-text="detail"></small></span><button type="button" class="secondary" data-op="contributions:confirm">Confirm match</button></div></template>
 <p class="muted" data-show="noSuggestions">No matching posted transfers found. Classify an outgoing personal entry as a transfer to suggest its matching shared deposit.</p>
 <h3>Confirmed contributions</h3><div data-list="pairs"></div><template data-row="pairs"><div class="alert-row"><span data-text="amount"></span><button type="button" class="secondary" data-op="contributions:unmatch">Remove match</button></div></template>
</section>
